# Voca Swiper word bank — A2. One word per line, fields separated by "|".
# text|pos|cefr|minAge|themes(;)|emoji|definition|example|vi|forms(k=v,k=v)
# pos: noun verb adjective adverb number preposition pronoun conjunction determiner
# forms: plural past "past participle" comparative superlative
# Order within a level = teaching order (most useful first). Words written
# in-house from topic areas; no published list copied (see docs/adr/0001).
# Ages 7+; pictures optional at this level. Vietnamese: northern form first,
# southern form in parentheses where they differ. Draft translations — review
# before store release.

